<title>FINLAND: FINLAND BANK RESERVES UP FIM 1.49 BILLION IN WEEK.</title>
<headline>FINLAND BANK RESERVES UP FIM 1.49 BILLION IN WEEK.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland's latest</p>
<p>balance sheet for the week to October 8 showed the following</p>
<p>positions in millions of markka compared to September 30:</p>
<p> Position			   Latest     Previous</p>
<p> Foreign reserves		 36,809	 35,315</p>
<p> Money market intervention    11,803	 10,147</p>
<p> Govt sector claims		5,999	  5,998</p>
<p> Corporate sector claims	 2,428	  2,429</p>
<p> Total assets		     65,080	 61,928</p>
<p>In the previous week, to September 30, reserves fell by 12</p>
<p>million markka.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-0-680 50 240</p>
</text>
